---
---

<!-- PC Footer (md以上) -->
<footer class="hidden md:block w-full border-t border-slate-200/60 bg-white/40 backdrop-blur-md py-12 mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_1fr_1fr] gap-10 mb-10">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-950 mb-1">VS GUIDE</h3>
        <p class="text-[10px] font-mono font-semibold tracking-widest text-slate-500 uppercase mb-3">
          Vampire Survivors Guide
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Vampire Survivorsの攻略・解説情報をまとめた非公式Wikiです。ステージ・ボス攻略、キャラクター解説、金策、アップデート情報などを掲載しています。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-800 mb-3">サイト内リンク</h4>
        <nav aria-label="フッターサイト内リンク">
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
            <li>
              <a href="/" class="hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">ホーム</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/#strategy" class="hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">
                ステージ・ボス攻略
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/characters/" class="hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">
                キャラクター
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/#gold" class="hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">金策</a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a href="/#updates" class="hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors">
                アップデート
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold tracking-wide text-slate-800 mb-3">外部リンク</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://note.com/neo_magical"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors"
            >
              note 攻略・解説記事集
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-400"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M15 3h6v6" />
                <path d="M10 14 21 3" />
                <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://www.youtube.com/@hirakouki_vs"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 hover:text-slate-950 transition-colors"
            >
              YouTube 攻略動画
              <svg
                class="w-3 h-3 text-slate-400"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="2"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                aria-hidden="true"
              >
                <path d="M15 3h6v6" />
                <path d="M10 14 21 3" />
                <path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6" />
              </svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-2 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200/40 text-[11px] text-slate-500">
      <p>© 2026 VS GUIDE.</p>
      <p>
        Vampire Survivors is a trademark of poncle limited. This site is an unofficial fan-made guide and is not affiliated with or endorsed by poncle.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

